WEBVTT

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:01.033
to greenhouse gas emissions.

00:02:01.075 --> 00:02:03.661
A hyperloop system
can begin to change this trend

00:02:03.703 --> 00:02:05.288
before the end of the decade,

00:02:05.329 --> 00:02:08.583
by transforming short-haul
journeys and commutes

00:02:08.624 --> 00:02:10.793
from hours to minutes.

00:02:11.627 --> 00:02:17.300
Our system is inspiring
a new category of companies

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:19.719
dedicated to bringing this to life.

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:22.054
But it's going to take
more than just vision.

00:02:22.054 --> 00:02:26.058
History's full of ideas
that have flopped and flourished,

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:29.103
and this one’s just too important
for us not to get right.

00:02:29.979 --> 00:02:31.314
So I am an engineer,